notes.content:
Hello everyone, thank you so much for your support and help. EA of Prime of Flames will be launched on Aug 25th 2022(PST). 
Also I will update a new Demo soon with English supported. I am really sorry for the delay of English version. Really hope that you guys will like my game.

EA Version will include:

Three Races and Five Classes with Over One Hundred Characters;
There are Six Chapters for Every Race;
Unlock all the Features in Camp;
Unlock Endless Mode;
Dozens of BOSSES are waiting for your Challenge;
A lot of Treasures, Skills and Items；


Looking forward to meeting you in Prime of Flames. Adding Wishlist Please!

